WEBVTT - Release and open source: agent skills for TYPO3 (en)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:08.871
Shipping an extension takes more than code: a
release, documentation and a safe supply chain.

2
00:00:09.971 --> 00:00:15.234
Release and open source: four skills for TYPO3
v14.

3
00:00:16.534 --> 00:00:23.417
Prepares the first public 1.0.0 release of an
extension for TER or Packagist.

4
00:00:24.767 --> 00:00:29.273
Updating version strings is the smallest part of
a release.

5
00:00:30.673 --> 00:00:40.482
Writes extension documentation that renders on
docs.typo3.org, from guides.xml to screenshots.

6
00:00:41.832 --> 00:00:51.405
A wrong namespace in guides.xml stops a manual
from rendering, so the skill generates that file
instead of typing it.

7
00:00:52.805 --> 00:01:00.654
Helps contribute to TYPO3 Core: Forge issues,
Gerrit patches, cherry-picks and CI logs.

8
00:01:02.004 --> 00:01:07.920
Gerrit has its own rules, from work-in-progress
pushes to keeping the Change-Id.

9
00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:16.908
Assesses production readiness: supply-chain
security, CI/CD hardening and quality gates.

10
00:01:18.258 --> 00:01:25.245
It makes the build and signing of a release
traceable, from SHA-pinned actions to signed
artefacts.

11
00:01:26.845 --> 00:01:31.089
Open source. Clone the skills, and help us
improve them.
